# interval tuned per-agency from real dep_delay-change rates (2026-08-20):
# aomori's upstream feed changes ~58% of the time within 30s (30s justified);
# the mcapps.jp feeds (8/9/10) change only ~20% within 30s, so 60s loses
# almost no real signal while roughly halving RT archive volume.
# id	name	interval	feed_url	static_url	ping_url
1	aomori	30	https://aomoricitybus.com/TripUpdate.pb		https://hc-ping.com/FILL-ME-1
8	hiroden	60	https://ajt-mobusta-gtfs.mcapps.jp/realtime/8/trip_updates.bin	https://ajt-mobusta-gtfs.mcapps.jp/static/8/current_data.zip	https://hc-ping.com/FILL-ME-8
9	hirobus	60	https://ajt-mobusta-gtfs.mcapps.jp/realtime/9/trip_updates.bin	https://ajt-mobusta-gtfs.mcapps.jp/static/9/current_data.zip	https://hc-ping.com/FILL-ME-9
10	hiroko	60	https://ajt-mobusta-gtfs.mcapps.jp/realtime/10/trip_updates.bin	https://ajt-mobusta-gtfs.mcapps.jp/static/10/current_data.zip	https://hc-ping.com/FILL-ME-10
